e: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">个场馆。其中招聘活动板块占</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">个场馆，将提供</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体\">600</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">个招聘展位和</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体\">80</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">块（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体\">1.4m</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">宽</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-